morse-firmware (20251207-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging: snapshot MorseMicro/morse-firmware commit
    974c7744263ffb56a1c8678962e740fdcb3428f7 ("Update Makefile to also
    install symlinks", 2025-12-07) — the same pin the image build
    previously fetched at build time via fetch_from_repo in
    recomputer-rk35xx-common.inc.
  * Ships morse/mm6108.bin (MM6108 standard firmware) and
    morse/bcf_default.bin (Quectel FGH100M-H US BCF, Wio-WM6108).
  * Replaces: armbian-bsp-* — the firmware files were previously baked
    into the BSP deb by post_family_tweaks_bsp__recomputer_fgh100m_
    morse_firmware; this package takes over those paths so existing
    images can apt-install it without a file conflict.

